; LocalChimera Radicle seed address.
;
; Copy this file to Persistent storage on each Tails install as:
;   /home/amnesia/Persistent/scripts/localchimera-seed.txt
;
; Contents: a single line of the form
;   <NID>@<onion>.onion:8776
;
; where:
;   <NID>   = `rad self --nid` on the localchimera seed server
;             (run as the localchimera user with HOME=/var/lib/localchimera/radicle)
;   <onion> = `cat /var/lib/tor/hidden-services/localchimera/hostname` on the server
;
; restore-radicle.sh reads this on every boot and adds the address to
; ~/.radicle/config.json under both `preferredSeeds` (so `rad sync` knows
; where to look) and `connect` (so the node holds the link open).
;
; Example (not real):
;   z6Mkhp7VUnuufpvuQ3PdysShAjL86VDRUpPpkesqiysDBGs9@odmmeotgcfx65l5hn6ejkaruvai222vs7o7tmtllszqk5xbysolfdd.onion:8776
